WEBVTT

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:25.390
I'll never forgive you...

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:28.270
I won't let anyone else die!

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:30.690
I won't let it end here.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.100
I'll protect everyone...

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.130
I'll protect Isla!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:13.370
Karl, don't let hatred rule you...

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:15.540
Focus only on the light.

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:18.710
If you forgive them...

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:23.720
We're here, Kal.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.540
Come on, stand up...

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.430
You're in top form again today, Ari.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:46.350
<b>Episode 1 
Island of New Journeys</b>

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:58.840
Dad! Thanks for everything!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.760
You're such a mess...

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.550
Look at your face.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:05.430
Your body's grown up, but you 
still have the mind of a child.

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.760
I'll be back!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.690
Kal, take care of Ariel.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:14.790
She always loses control.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:15.990
Yeah.

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:17.660
Right.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.650
Stay well, my sisters.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.740
Why so glum?

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:28.020
You're a man, so smile...

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:29.900
This is your big send-off.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:31.330
Dad...

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:35.010
Fly, Kal-el.

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:37.390
Keep the promise you made to your mom.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:43.330
Come on! Don't blush!

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:45.230
Aren't you a guy?

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.350
Shut up...

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:55.100
Say goodbye, or you'll regret it!

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:57.340
Yeah.

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:01.390
Thank you, Michael.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.610
I will definitely return.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:08.620
I'll find the End of the Sky, 
and become a great pilot.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.950
Right. Get going.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:24.010
Everyone, the day has finally arrived.

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:30.010
Many citizens have gathered here, 
at Wind Revolution Memorial Park.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:33.560
Balsteros, the Kingdom of Qi, and Benares

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:38.900
have joined together, and the journey to 
the unknown is about to commence!

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.860
So these are all pilot trainees, huh?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:46.180
What a bunch of weirdos.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:47.530
Ari...

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.940
It may be a little late,

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:50.350
but are you sure about this?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.510
It just feels

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:55.730
like I'm dragging you along...

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:57.700
We don't know when we'll return,

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.750
or even if we'll make it back at all.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.980
Listen, Kal...

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:08.780
I'm not doing any of this for you.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:09.840
But...

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.510
We're looking for the End of the Sky.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:15.810
In everyday life, you never have the 
chance at an adventure like this!

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.110
That's true, but...

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.350
Wing angle at 90!

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.610
Start the rotors!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:26.690
Wing angle at 90.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.700
Starting rotors!

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.030
Let's go.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.770
Hang on tightly.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.500
Take off!

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:07.730
We're flying!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.020
Takeoff complete.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.860
Hydrogen battery stacks functioning normally.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:53.200
Aerial Knights and trainees flying 
in v-formation on either side.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.110
Launch the <i>Luna Barco</i>.

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.330
Set a course for the ceremony grounds.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:11.280
They're alone?

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.810
Yeah, I heard one of the students was ill.

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:16.930
They're already on board.

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.180
Wow!

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:31.270
Upsy daisy.

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.570
Here I go!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.790
You sound like an old woman...

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.410
I'm gonna throw it really hard.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:44.140
In the beginning, there was a single drop of rain.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:48.420
The drop fell for seven days and seven nights,

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:51.420
and on the eighth, it fell upon a flagstone.

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:54.980
The rain was so happy, it continued to fall.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:56.860
It spread out, across the flagstone.

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:00.390
And it fell off the edge, into the abyss...

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:04.560
The flagstone mourned, and it pleaded with god.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:09.280
"Saint Aldista, what happens to the rain is so sad.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:11.820
I don't care what happens to me.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:14.700
But please save the rain."

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:19.850
And god heard its request, 
and split the stone in two.

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:24.110
The rain again pooled upon the two flagstones,

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.790
and it became a blue sea 
that spread over them.

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:29.630
The flagstone split once more,

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.880
and then, as it prepared to split a third time,

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.380
the flagstone gave thanks to god.

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:37.630
And it created the Holy Spring,

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:41.940
which shot water high into the sky,

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:45.140
and the End of the Sky, which kept 
the water from falling off its edge.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:50.480
And part of the flagstone flew up 
from within the Holy Spring,

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.500
and it became an island that floated in the sky.

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:58.880
Isla, the floating island!

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:04.200
To solve the mystery beginning the 
Creation Myth of Saint Aldista,

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:11.340
we now set out for the End of the Sky, 
which humanity has never seen.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.250
Leave port.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:54.920
Nina Viento!

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.300
Ah, it's Dad!

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:00.300
Hey!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.220
You can't see him from up here, you liar.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:06.200
No...

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:09.140
But I'm sure that by now, he's down there.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.480
He'd see off his son and daughter.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.830
Let's come back, no matter what...

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:18.610
Both of us.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:22.300
"Once we're real pilots." Right?

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:24.620
I don't need you to tell me that.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.780
You're such a brat.

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:28.300
You're my little brother, you know!

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:30.790
Right. Says the little sister.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:32.080
Little brother!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:32.920
Little sister!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:33.840
Little brother!

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:34.510
Little sister!

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:35.560
Little brother!

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:36.400
Little sister!

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:37.050
Little brother!

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:37.920
Little sister!

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.250
Our turn next, huh?

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:05.950
Don't screw it up!

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:07.620
Shut up...

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:20.730
Calm down, you idiot!

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:22.970
I'm not an idiot!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.970
Keep the propellers forward, and lower the nose.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.110
Quickly!

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:31.060
That was embarrassing.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.980
What an awful way to start, all thanks to you!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.050
I couldn't help it...

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:36.360
The wind came out of nowhere.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:40.120
"Ah, save me, Ari! Save me!"

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:42.400
What the hell? I never said that!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.170
"I'm not an idiot!"

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.970
Well, I did say that.

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:02.920
They're pretty careless.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.660
What are you doing?!

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:22.290
L-Listen, don't let it get you down.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:23.070
I didn't do much—

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.370
Creepy!

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:43.770
So we have to walk from here?

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.710
Why don't they?

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:47.420
That can't be helped.

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:51.760
In class A, all the children are noble.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:56.600
You are the students of Cadoques High, 
Aerial Division, class 1B, yes?

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:00.690
Welcome to the town of Centezual.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.900
I am Shizuka Hazome.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:08.170
I am in charge of managing these dorms.

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:19.880
A corner room?

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:21.070
Lucky.

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:24.790
I am Kal-el Albus.

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:25.810
Nice to meet you.

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.780
I'm Noriaki Kashiwabara.

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.340
And that's...

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.680
I'm Mitsuo Fukuhara.

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:45.400
Ariel?

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.880
Huh? What are you doing over there?!

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:53.360
Don't shout!

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:54.740
It's embarrassing!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.410
You're yelling, too!

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.540
I'm allowed to yell. You aren't.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:01.000
What was that? You're my little brother!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.500
You're my little sister!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:03.790
My...

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.390
Little brother? Little sister?

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:07.630
Those two...

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.630
What do you suppose their relationship is?

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:13.640
Whatever they are, it's going 
to be lively around here.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.260
"Save me! Save me!"

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:16.510
Just shut up!

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:18.640
I'm not an idiot...

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.700
Is something wrong?

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.910
W-Well, um...

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:41.540
Wait... Kal?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.630
What's with him?

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.830
Insulting me...

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:08.320
<i>It isn't as though I want to be here, either!</i>

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.940
<i>Journey into the unknown?</i>

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:12.470
<i>Ha...</i>

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.320
<i>They just want to be rid of me.</i>

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:28.690
Um...

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.760
Want me to take a look?

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:45.310
The chain's loose.

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:51.510
Here you go, fixed.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:56.490
What's wrong?

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.730
I'm not sure I get it, but calm down.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.890
First, try taking a deep breath.

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.580
Um!

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:17.190
Um, thank you!

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:19.800
That uniform... The flight school, right?

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:22.600
Y-Yeah... Why?

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:23.560
Um...

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:25.940
Actually...

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.780
Are you one of us?

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.090
I see...

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:35.070
I'm Kal-el Albus.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.140
And you are?

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.560
Claire...

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:42.330
Claire Cruz.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.460
Nice to meet you, Claire.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:48.330
Nice to meet you, Kal-el.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.160
Yeah.

00:17:49.970 --> 00:17:53.370
Did you miss the ceremonial flight?

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:55.550
Is it all right for you to be out here?

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.100
What's wrong?

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:04.110
Curfew... I have to get back.

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:08.280
Is your house in Van Whyl?

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:11.230
I'll take you there.

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.530
If it gets dark, it could be dangerous.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.120
Wow!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:28.100
It's bright red...

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:30.430
The sunset feels totally different.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:35.900
This is the sky, isn't it?

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:38.630
We're floating in the sky.

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:41.180
Yeah.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.400
What's this?

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:52.050
I get it...

00:18:52.050 --> 00:18:55.670
Isla flies at the same height as the clouds.

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:12.630
We're riding above the clouds.

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:33.080
Whoops.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.560
We fell in the lake, huh?

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:46.950
That voice!

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:53.880
I'll get you!

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.300
W-Watch out!

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:41.090
Okay, I'm heading back.

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.480
Your pass.

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:51.350
No, I'm...

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:55.610
Hacienda Gate is the entrance to the nobles' area.

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:57.480
Only those with permission can pass.

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:01.480
Um...

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:05.990
Th-Thank you for holding me so tightly!

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:21.570
What a funny girl.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:25.350
"Thank you for holding me so tightly," she said.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:30.470
Claire Cruz... Claire Cruz!

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:32.160
Claire Cruz!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.320
I will come back,

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.270
Mother.

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:51.990
<i>And so, Isla left on a journey from 
which it would never return.</i>

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:57.020
<i>We still hadn't learned how 
cruel the world could be.</i>

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.890
I am Ignacio Axis.

00:23:33.230 --> 00:23:35.970
We're pairing up for flight class.

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:38.890
I don't care who I get, except that blond guy.

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:39.850
To begin with, a pair is—

00:23:39.850 --> 00:23:40.890
<b>Episode 2 
Cadoques High, Aerial Division</b>

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:42.890
<b></b>

00:23:42.890 --> 00:23:44.890
<b></b>
